WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.533
Just Speak to It for Windows, in beta. Sample data: fictional History and fixed test text.

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:05.533
The dashboard shows your shortcut, model and recent text

00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:08.533
Press Ctrl+Alt+Space in any app to start

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:11.533
A small overlay shows the words as you speak

00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:14.067
Stop, and the text goes back into the window you were in

00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:17.067
Choose the microphone, text output, and the speak CLI and MCP

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:19.600
Windows beta. Download at justspeaktoit.com
